{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4e219df4-cbd9-8272-a430-faa0e4af917f",
  "created_at": "2025-12-11T12:54:18-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Bridget Reardon",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:52:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:52:07-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. I think I'm calling the right place? It's about a streetlight pole, or maybe it's a utility pole, I'm not sure which. It sort of leans now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:52:18-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, leaning how? Did something hit it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:52:21-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, a car hit it. I think it was Monday night, maybe late, because I heard a bang and by morning there was glass in the road and the pole was tilted over. Nobody's come to look at it, as far as I can tell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:52:37-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. And where is this pole?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:52:40-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's right out front of me, 413 Eustis Avenue. Up on the Hill. I rent there, so I'm not the one who can do anything about it, I think."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:52:51-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's fine, you did the right thing calling. Is the light still working on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:52:57-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, it sort of flickers. Maybe it's on at night and maybe it isn't. Honestly, I'd say it's off more than on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:53:05-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Are there any wires hanging down or sparking, anything low to the ground?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:53:11-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't think so. I didn't see any wires on the ground. It just leans toward the sidewalk, sort of at an angle, and I'd rather it not come down on somebody."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:53:22-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll put in a request for a crew to go out and check the pole today. Can I get a number in case they need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:53:32-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0193. Oh, and one more thing. I got a text yesterday from some number I don't know, about the pole I think, or maybe about something else. I didn't answer it. It seemed like the sort of thing that's a scam."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:53:47-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good call not answering it. We don't text people about repairs out of the blue. If anyone from the city needs you, they'll phone or come by."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:53:57-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's what I figured. I just wish somebody had come already. It's been three days, I think."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:54:04-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I'm flagging it as a leaning pole so it gets looked at sooner, not just added to the list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:54:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. I'd appreciate that. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T12:54:15-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care now."
    }
  ],
